    enonce: "<span class=\"q\">1) </span>بيّن أنّ: <span dir=\"ltr\" class=\"expr\">A = b - a + 8</span> حيث <span dir=\"ltr\" class=\"expr\">A = 9 - (a + 4) - (-3) + b</span><br><span class=\"q\">2) </span>بيّن أنّ: <span dir=\"ltr\" class=\"expr\">A = b - a + 8</span> حيث <span dir=\"ltr\" class=\"expr\">B = b - a + 12</span> <span dir=\"ltr\" class=\"expr\">B = 8 - (a + 4) - (-8) + b</span><br><span class=\"q\">3) </span>بيّن أنّ: <span dir=\"ltr\" class=\"expr\">A = b - a + 8</span> حيث <span dir=\"ltr\" class=\"expr\">B = b - a + 12</span> <span dir=\"ltr\" class=\"expr\">C = b - a - 12</span> <span dir=\"ltr\" class=\"expr\">C = -8 - (4 - b + a)</span><br><span class=\"q\">4) </span>بيّن أنّ: <span dir=\"ltr\" class=\"expr\">A = b - a + 8</span> حيث <span dir=\"ltr\" class=\"expr\">B = b - a + 12</span> <span dir=\"ltr\" class=\"expr\">C = b - a - 12</span> <span dir=\"ltr\" class=\"expr\">D = -x - y - 4</span> <span dir=\"ltr\" class=\"expr\">D = (x + z) - x - [4 - (-x - y - z)]</span><br><span class=\"q\">5) </span>بيّن أنّ: <span dir=\"ltr\" class=\"expr\">A = b - a + 8</span> حيث <span dir=\"ltr\" class=\"expr\">B = b - a + 12</span> <span dir=\"ltr\" class=\"expr\">C = b - a - 12</span> <span dir=\"ltr\" class=\"expr\">D = -x - y - 4</span> <span dir=\"ltr\" class=\"expr\">E = 2</span> <span dir=\"ltr\" class=\"expr\">E = -7 - (x - 5) - [-9 - (x - 5)]</span>",
